---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Delete a stored key

Usage: mxr llm key remove [OPTIONS] <PROVIDER>

Arguments:
  <PROVIDER>  [possible values: anthropic, openai, openrouter]

Options:
      --dry-run          Show what would be removed, without removing it
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
